fixture pogo_down_dash_pogo
doc BUILD.md s5 tech 4 "pogo, dash, pogo again crosses anything"; s5 Pogo "Chain window: frame 6": pogo off the bell, air-dash down-left past it, pogo the spikes below
room test/spikes
spawn 1216 300
frames 60
input
  0..11 D
  12..13 D attack
  14..16 D
  17 D L dash
  18..20 D L
  21..30 D L attack
  31..59 D L
end
expect
  at 14 event.pogo=1
  at 17 event.dash=1
  mark second 18..40 event.pogo=1
  never 0..59 event.hazard=1
end
